(
    title: "Crack\'ed",
    description: Some("Defend rare Hornbill eggs from a slingshot post as thieving predators raid the nests, across three stages the 2600 kept from its bigger siblings — the Yolk Tree, a sewer crawl, and the odd-aiming Rooster Ranch bonus round. The port was nearly finished but never shipped: development dragged into late 1988 as the 2600 market dried up, leaving screen-bounce glitches and a bonus-level crash frozen in the surviving proto."),
